    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>大家好，請教大家是否也有碰過同樣的問題～</div><div>最近想要使用Shinyapps.io，需要安裝&quot;devtools&quot;的套件，打了<span style=\"color:blue;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8666667938232px;line-height:15.2533330917358px;white-space:pre-wrap\">install.packages(&quot;devtools&quot;, dependencies = TRUE)</span></div><div>但是怎麼也安裝不起來:(</div><div><br></div><div>錯誤訊息是<br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8666667938232px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533330917358px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">* installing *source* package ‘xml2’ ...\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">** package ‘xml2’ successfully unpacked and MD5 sums checked\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Pack<span style=\"font-size:13.8666667938232px;line-height:15.2533330917358px\">age libxml-2.0 was not found in the pkg-config search path.</span><br>Perhaps you should add the directory containing `libxml-2.0.pc&#39;<br>to the PKG_CONFIG_PATH environment variable\r\nNo package &#39;libxml-2.0&#39; found\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Package libxml-2.0 was not found in the pkg-config search path.\r\nPerhaps you should add the directory containing `libxml-2.0.pc&#39;\r\nto the PKG_CONFIG_PATH environment variable\r\nNo package &#39;libxml-2.0&#39; found\r\n</span>Could not find libxml2. Please install libxml2-devel (rpm) or libxml2-dev (deb).\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">ERROR: configuration failed for package ‘xml2’\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">* removing ‘/home/yiting/R/i686-redhat-linux-gnu-library/3.1/xml2’\r\n</span>Warning in install.packages :\r\n  installation of package ‘xml2’ had non-zero exit status\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">ERROR: dependency ‘xml2’ is not available for package ‘rversions’\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">* removing ‘/home/yiting/R/i686-redhat-linux-gnu-library/3.1/rversions’\r\n</span>Warning in install.packages :\r\n  installation of package ‘rversions’ had non-zero exit status\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">ERROR: dependency ‘rversions’ is not available for package ‘devtools’\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">* removing ‘/home/yiting/R/i686-redhat-linux-gnu-library/3.1/devtools’\r\n</span>Warning in install.packages :\r\n  installation of package ‘devtools’ had non-zero exit status\r\n\r\nThe downloaded source packages are in\r\n\t‘/tmp/Rtmpvz0ZSk/downloaded_packages’</pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>目前的作業系統是centOS，R及R-Studio版本已安裝到最新，</div><div>上網查了一下，嘗試過以下網頁的指令，</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://www.linuxquestions.org/questions/linux-software-2/no-package-&#39;libxml-2-0&#39;-found-627837/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.linuxquestions.org/questions/linux-software-2/no-package-&#39;libxml-2-0&#39;-found-627837/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238274288000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Yf5KLvyJI7IteQ2BY5nf6\">http://www.linuxquestions.org/questions/linux-software-2/no-package-&#39;libxml-2-0&#39;-found-627837/</a><br></div><div>在linux上打了 yum install libxml2-devel ，但是出現&quot;程式記憶體區段錯誤 (core dumped)&quot; 的錯誤訊息<br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/20923209/problems-installing-the-devtools-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/20923209/problems-installing-the-devtools-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238274288000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Uojb4h167Ebi2QKAo3kR_\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/20923209/problems-installing-the-devtools-package</a><br></div><div>這一篇使用<span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">sudo yum </span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">y install libcurl libcurl</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">devel</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"> 的指令，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\">但還是無法解決安裝的問題</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, Lucida Console, Liberation Mono, DejaVu Sans Mono, Bitstream Vera Sans Mono, Courier New, monospace, sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/devtools/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/devtools/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238274288000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32rgFFDuThlDEYmG9jcOWa\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/devtools/index.html</a></font><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, Lucida Console, Liberation Mono, DejaVu Sans Mono, Bitstream Vera Sans Mono, Courier New, monospace, sans-serif\">也到了這邊下載下面的zip/tgz檔，強制install它，package裡是出現了&quot;devtools&quot;，但是卻無法library。</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, Lucida Console, Liberation Mono, DejaVu Sans Mono, Bitstream Vera Sans Mono, Courier New, monospace, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Consolas, Menlo, Monaco, Lucida Console, Liberation Mono, DejaVu Sans Mono, Bitstream Vera Sans Mono, Courier New, monospace, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div>以上，請教大家如何安裝devtools的套件，感謝!<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
